## Fase 7 — Producción y DevOps (cuando se planifique deploy)
*Resuelve: 1.17, S3-Importante, S3-Detalles. Se implementa solo cuando se planifique un deploy real.*

### Paso 7.1 — Dockerfile multi-stage para server
**Archivos a crear:**
- `server/Dockerfile`:
  ```dockerfile
  FROM node:20-alpine AS base
  WORKDIR /app

  FROM base AS build
  COPY package*.json ./
  RUN npm ci
  COPY . .
  RUN npx prisma generate && npm run build

  FROM base AS production
  COPY --from=build /app/dist ./dist
  COPY --from=build /app/node_modules ./node_modules
  COPY --from=build /app/package.json ./
  COPY --from=build /app/prisma ./prisma
  USER node
  EXPOSE 3000
  CMD ["node", "dist/main.js"]
  ```

### Paso 7.2 — Dockerfile multi-stage para client
**Archivos a crear:**
- `client/Dockerfile`:
  ```dockerfile
  FROM node:20-alpine AS build
  WORKDIR /app
  COPY package*.json ./
  RUN npm ci
  COPY . .
  RUN npm run build

  FROM nginx:alpine AS production
  COPY --from=build /app/dist /usr/share/nginx/html
  COPY nginx.conf /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf
  EXPOSE 80
  ```
- `client/nginx.conf` — Config de SPA (todas las rutas → `index.html`).

### Paso 7.3 — Actualizar `docker-compose.yml`
**Archivos a modificar:**
- `docker-compose.yml` — Agregar servicios `server` y `client` usando los Dockerfiles.

### Paso 7.4 — CI/CD Pipeline
**Archivos a crear:**
- `.github/workflows/ci.yml`:
  ```yaml
  name: CI
  on: [push, pull_request]
  jobs:
    backend:
      steps:
        - npm ci
        - npm run lint
        - npm run build
        - npm run test
        - npm run test:arch
        - npm audit --audit-level=moderate
    frontend:
      steps:
        - npm ci
        - npm run lint
        - npm run build
        - npm run test
  ```

### Paso 7.5 — Meta tags y SEO básico
**Archivos a instalar:**
```bash
cd client && npm install react-helmet-async
```
Envolver la app en `<HelmetProvider>`. En cada página principal, agregar `<Helmet><title>Dashboard | Mi Carrerita</title></Helmet>`.

